{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "321a71ae921223f1cd298fd628baa80a3c599a11e0f734d9ed79abce292e5691", "ja": "はじまりの、おわり", "zh": "开始的、结束", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d860bf0a079c17d318be3d680269e79a16d0297db08874d6b1188ac37ddf63ae", "ja": "第一回公演は大成功。下町の老舗料理店で\n打ち上げをする事に。お店に向かいながら、\n思い思いに感想を語り合うメンバー。\nこのショウはまだ、始まったばかり。", "zh": "第一场公演大获成功。大家决定在下町的老字号餐馆举办庆功宴。成员们一边前往餐馆，一边各自谈论着感想。\n这场演出才刚刚开始。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e7e9639bb096a3c6de29cdaa9e1a1249f00687b85290cf8c411f21d06ce9d88", "ja": "（第一回公演は無事終了。ショウの始まりを\n感じさせる、素晴らしい開演セレモニーだった！）", "zh": "（第一场公演顺利结束。这是一场让人感受到演出开端的精彩开幕仪式！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "a3eec552fc36ee8f67a0228838ad057b82ed8795b8a9cede0aa8d8e804233c0b", "ja": "（そして今日は、下町の老舗料理店で打ち上げを\nする事になっている。みんな、もう集まってるかな？）", "zh": "（然后今天决定在下町的老字号餐馆举办庆功宴。大家已经聚齐了吗？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1002_p", "source_sha256": "53bc244f099f82441e8400959e618e5efb800af0bf25d383b4806d211ca2d654", "ja": "お疲れ様！\nお、4人とも、そろってるな。", "zh": "辛苦了！\n哦，4人也都到齐了啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1003_049mom", "source_sha256": "2fced6854dce5339946cb8a8163d97aec41dc3e70b54facadd95382ce965cba5", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん。やっと来た。\nちょっと遅いんじゃない？", "zh": "啊，哥哥。你终于来了。\n是不是有点晚了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4dfa4ec1a50741358186d05bf32b8157a3853cabbf98736faff5d05a15968362", "ja": "ご、ごめん。時間ピッタリに着いたつもりだけど\n……というか、みんな早かったんだな？", "zh": "对、对不起。我本来以为自己是准时到的……\n话说回来，大家都来得挺早啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e39c58ba7248a114f3c6846a56bac78f9ea556879d211ab50846a5dbece06ae1", "ja": "私たちは、打ち上げが楽しみで。\nつい早く来ちゃったんです♪", "zh": "我们是因为太期待庆功宴了，\n忍不住就来早了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1006_p", "source_sha256": "c4cc4db8d884ff3ac29c10c150b8f6758b28c2f73ad46a06bd6c8e331a7c9b70", "ja": "ああ、そうだったのか。\nそれは待たせて悪かった。", "zh": "啊，原来是这样。\n抱歉让你们久等了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1007_021mat", "source_sha256": "81f929eff60759dcfb3493a84d4ada572da80967f20e8f5f5fec74cb565cc11c", "ja": "大丈夫なのです。{$P$}さんが\n来るまで、公演の話で盛り上がっていたのです。", "zh": "没关系的。在{$P$}先生来之前，\n我们一直在聊演出的事，聊得可开心了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1008_029umi", "source_sha256": "25ed3db5fa3d6a58a9d107e6658f3b39c6c7f3d0a1b470ff5964d26dfec34616", "ja": "そうそう！　すっごく楽しかったね～、とか！\nあのシーンすっごくよかったよね～、とか！", "zh": "对对！比如“真的特别开心呢～”，还有“那一幕真的特别棒呢～”之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1009_049mom", "source_sha256": "f9a58b7ed930515d59fad2f591ced4dfc679860ed70b93d91a2e67167e30270c", "ja": "うん。\n桃子も、けっこう楽しかった。", "zh": "嗯。\n桃子也挺开心的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "24fc6e75873cdbedfd37bb4a9c487ddaf9b32c695651da3b49aa06577d84b609", "ja": "ももちん……。", "zh": "桃子……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1011_049mom", "source_sha256": "56942c8dd86c86dfcb3260cfdb61ab569145b31faf4f50ae31a3faf144cae343", "ja": "みんなと、お芝居の息とか……感覚も合ってたし。\n……いい公演だったんじゃないかな。", "zh": "和大家的配合，演戏的默契……感觉都很合拍。\n……算是一场不错的演出吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1012_029umi", "source_sha256": "845a72cfaf7c0f033079e7c31a8b3aa786f0860ef012f9fa22f5cd8faf623c17", "ja": "うんうん！\nやっぱり、交流会をやったおかげだよね！", "zh": "嗯嗯！\n果然还是多亏举办了交流会！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1013_049mom", "source_sha256": "03c781fe43970ec0b34862365c5d1fbf4cd303b77220f5338aa95246797bd872", "ja": "それはわかんないけど。", "zh": "这个我就不知道了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1014_029umi", "source_sha256": "08a44ccf16cbc9319a5978d9d3d237692eff225899a32c46675b354077277d8d", "ja": "えーっ！？", "zh": "咦──！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1015_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b80bd913df5db56c4b7eb9e94faed0a846f9ae6c8a1bf2712e329c400be7f984", "ja": "ふふっ！　お客さんも楽しんでくれたみたいだし、\nみんなで頑張ってよかったよね♪", "zh": "呵呵！客人们好像也玩得很开心，大家一起努力真是太好了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1016_021mat", "source_sha256": "4f0b3194c9da256f59dfc40bd4027d69e8fff0800e289f84e1f7ed8b57ef27ce", "ja": "はいなのです！　みんなで頑張ったから、\nすーぱー・わんだほー！な公演になったのです！", "zh": "是的！因为大家一起努力了，才有了这场超级精彩的演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1017_p", "source_sha256": "b44677c75271adf84dbf10456c2a8b27797bb62080d682683fc5aa6ae02a899f", "ja": "そうだな。次に繋がる、いい公演だったと思うよ。\n改めて、本当にお疲れ様！　それじゃ、行こうか。", "zh": "是啊。我觉得这是场能为下一次演出打下基础的精彩公演。\n\n再次说一声，真的辛苦了！那么，我们走吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1018_049mom", "source_sha256": "650189d36c932bc725b9948e10f559d07006eb155b92bc508a62bdd221439625", "ja": "うん。\n今日は、おいしいもの食べなくちゃね♪", "zh": "嗯。\n今天可得吃点好吃的才行♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1019_p", "source_sha256": "f984e41a6c337cfa372310b248fdbde0282d807b19afbf4c9345410892dd35bc", "ja": "（最初の公演は終わったが、\nショウはまだ、始まったばかり……）", "zh": "（首场公演虽然结束了，但演出才刚刚开始……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0329_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0329_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "96828f58755d4bf7cca802cf3434e1e4fa423d4187c056510bd4ba9678c0d438", "ja": "（長い長い物語を、これからもひとつずつ\nみんなで紡いでいこう。ここからが本番だ……！）", "zh": "（今后也要和大家一起，一点一点编织出这段漫长、漫长的故事。从这里才是正式开始……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
